<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>The Devil I Know</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Mae Hill</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">The Devil I Know</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">7k75y6b7WkIZOFzS2wYx4m</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.590" end="00:18.810">DRINK LIKE A SAILOR</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.810" end="00:20.310">OH I</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.740" end="00:21.480">SMOKE WHEN I WAKE UP</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.480" end="00:23.100">_I</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.100" end="00:25.140">GET HIGH ON WEEKNIGHTS</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.140" end="00:29.460">ALL OF THE TIME</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.460" end="00:32.760">BURNT THROUGH MY PAYCHECK</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.760" end="00:34.260">OH MY</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.850" end="00:34.710">MOM THINKS THAT I’M DEAD</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.710" end="00:36.210">_I</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.090" end="00:41.130">HAVENT SEEN DAYLIGHT IN A WEEK/FOR A WHILE</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.130" end="00:42.630">SO YOU</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.060" end="00:47.850">WATCH ME WHILE I END UP TURNING EVERY GOD DAMN VIRTUE TO VICE</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.850" end="00:49.350">OH BUT</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.570" end="00:50.550">ALL THESE BAD HABITS</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.550" end="00:56.100">GOT ME FEELING ALIVE</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.100" end="00:59.310">I KEEP DANCING WITH THE DEVIL I KNOW</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.310" end="01:02.430">GUESS ITS BETTER THAN SLEEPING ALONE</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.430" end="01:05.580">I KEEP FLIRTING WITH A LOADED GUN</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.580" end="01:08.730">BETTER THE DEVIL THAN NO ONE</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.730" end="01:11.910">NO POINT IN RUNNING  I'LL JUST  RUN RIGHT BACK</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.910" end="01:15.330">BACK TO THE COMFORT OF THE BEATEN TRACK</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.330" end="01:17.940">TO KEEP ON DANCING WITH THE DEVIL I KNOW</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.940" end="01:19.440">THE DEVIL I KNOW</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.480" end="01:23.250">THE DEVIL I KNOW</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.250" end="01:26.160">FELL IN WITH THE WRONG CROWD</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.160" end="01:29.490">IM NOT MADE FOR A SMALL TOWN</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.490" end="01:31.950">HAD TO LEARN THE HARD WAY</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.950" end="01:37.140">WHAT GOES UP MUST COME DOWN</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.140" end="01:45.140">IT FEELS GOOD SO HOW CAN IT BE WRONG</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.620" end="01:53.700">I KEEP DANCING WITH THE DEVIL I KNOW</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.700" end="01:55.950">GUESS ITS BETTER THAN SLEEPING ALONE</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.950" end="01:59.100">I KEEP FLIRTING WITH A LOADED GUN</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.100" end="02:02.280">BETTER THE DEVIL THAN NO ONE</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.280" end="02:05.430">NO POINT IN RUNNING  I'LL JUST  RUN RIGHT BACK</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.430" end="02:09.780">BACK TO THE COMFORT OF THE BEATEN TRACK</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.780" end="02:17.780">TO KEEP ON DANCING WITH THE DEVIL I KNOW</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:26.430" end="02:34.430">THE DEVIL I KNOW</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:36.300" end="02:40.300">THE DEVIL I KNOW</p></div></body></tt>